From cd20b535b04555e0b03705e638d3f524010f69b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:56:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-32: the live tip while dragging; every component's
 name on the surface (0.32.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- While a component moves / resizes, its label shows the numbers going into
  its style: "left 73　top 14" when moving, "248 × 48" (and left / top for the
  w / n handles) when resizing -- WPF's live tip.
- 右鍵 > 顯示所有元件名稱: a small tag with its name at every visible
  component's top-left corner (at most 1500, only those on screen; not the
  design-hidden); "名稱" in the status bar; kept across a re-draw.

Tests: probe (the tip reads the style's left / top mid-drag on both pages;
name tags on every component, the button's among them; off), smoke 101,
real VS Code 103 (22 name tags on HotPlate; off again), lib 124, panels --
all pass; NO-SAVES.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
